---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Publications"
description: "A PhD dissertation, an MS thesis, and five peer-reviewed conference papers on mixed reality interaction design, health informatics, and IT curriculum."
bodyClass: content-layer
ogSlug: publications
---
<section class="section wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow">Publications</div>
  <h1>Peer-reviewed work, with the receipts.</h1>
  <p class="lead" style="max-width: 660px;">
    Research from the PhD and MS years: mixed reality interaction design, rapid prototyping methods
    for head-worn displays, and what actually counts as an IT degree. Every entry links to the
    publisher's record of the paper, not a summary of it.
  </p>

  <div class="metrics" style="margin-top: 3rem; max-width: 620px;">
    <div>
      <div class="metric__value">22</div>
      <div class="metric__label">Citations</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="metric__value">2</div>
      <div class="metric__label">h-index</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="metric__value">1</div>
      <div class="metric__label">i10-index</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="small" style="margin-top: 1.25rem; color: var(--rg-ash);">
    Per <a href="{{ site.scholar }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--accent);">Google Scholar</a>, as of August 2026.
  </p>

  <h2 class="section-label" style="margin-top: 4rem;">Dissertation &amp; Thesis</h2>
  <div>
    {% for pub in collections.publications %}{% if pub.data.type == "dissertation" or pub.data.type == "thesis" %}
    <a href="{{ pub.url }}" class="post-list__item">
      <div>
        <h3 class="post-list__title">{{ pub.data.title }}</h3>
        <p class="small" style="margin: 0.4rem 0 0; color: var(--rg-slate);">{{ pub.data.description }}</p>
      </div>
      <span class="post-list__meta">{{ pub.data.venue.short }} &middot; {{ pub.data.year }}</span>
    </a>
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </div>

  <h2 class="section-label" style="margin-top: 3.5rem;">Conference Papers &amp; Talks</h2>
  <div>
    {% for pub in collections.publications %}{% if pub.data.type != "dissertation" and pub.data.type != "thesis" %}
    <a href="{{ pub.url }}" class="post-list__item">
      <div>
        <h3 class="post-list__title">{{ pub.data.title }}</h3>
        <p class="small" style="margin: 0.4rem 0 0; color: var(--rg-slate);">
          {%- for a in pub.data.authors -%}{{ a.name }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{%- endfor -%}
          {%- if pub.data.citations %} &middot; {{ pub.data.citations }} citations{% endif %}
        </p>
      </div>
      <span class="post-list__meta">{{ pub.data.venue.short }}</span>
    </a>
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </div>

  <p class="small" style="margin-top: 2.5rem; color: var(--rg-ash);">
    Longer-form independent analysis lives in <a href="/reports/" style="color: var(--accent);">Reports</a>.
  </p>
</section>
